.env
backend/.env
frontend/.env.local

# OS/editor
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Local patch-application artifacts (30 Sep 2026: a *.patch file left in the
# repo root after `git apply` got swept up by ship.ps1's `git add -A` and
# committed, which then made `git diff --check` flag "trailing whitespace"
# on the patch file's own diff-formatted text -- not a real code issue,
# just a leftover handoff file. Ignored so this can't happen again.)
*.patch

# Key material and secret backups (3 Oct 2026). A backup of a real
# encryption key, saved into this folder as top_encryption_key.txt, was
# committed to this public repo on 1 Oct by ship.ps1's `git add -A`. Keep
# key backups in a password manager, never in the project folder -- these
# patterns are a seatbelt, not the plan. scripts/check_no_secrets.py is the
# real guard (it also reads file contents, and runs in ship.ps1 and in CI);
# this just stops such a file from being staged in the first place.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*_key.txt
*-key.txt
*_keys.txt
*-keys.txt
*encryption_key*
*secret_key*
*private_key*
